{com}. 
. foreach g in gap_q gap_old gap_rur {c -(}
{txt}  2{com}.     use `G', clear
{txt}  3{com}.     keep if !missing(`g')
{txt}  4{com}.     bysort iso3 (svy_year): keep if _n == _N
{txt}  5{com}.     * (a) v3 model, full sample
.     regress `g' oop lngdp, vce(robust)
{txt}  6{com}.     putb `V' "pov.`g'.base" oop
{txt}  7{com}.     * (b) same model on the countries that have a poverty point
.     regress `g' oop lngdp if !missing(pov_spl), vce(robust)
{txt}  8{com}.     putb `V' "pov.`g'.base_povsample" oop
{txt}  9{com}.     * (c) + societal poverty headcount
.     regress `g' oop lngdp pov_spl, vce(robust)
{txt} 10{com}.     putb `V' "pov.`g'.spl" oop
{txt} 11{com}.     putb `V' "pov.`g'.spl_pov" pov_spl
{txt} 12{com}.     * (d) + extreme poverty headcount instead
.     regress `g' oop lngdp pov_ipl, vce(robust)
{txt} 13{com}.     putb `V' "pov.`g'.ipl" oop
{txt} 14{com}.     putb `V' "pov.`g'.ipl_pov" pov_ipl
{txt} 15{com}.     * (e) poverty only (does OOP add anything?)
.     regress `g' pov_spl lngdp if !missing(oop), vce(robust)
{txt} 16{com}.     put `V' "pov.`g'.r2_povonly" e(r2)
